 紐約新訂單以官方摘要月份及 NOCDISA CSV 同月同值交叉核對，不使用未來新訂單欄。M1B−M2 保留實際觀測月份，另核對央行最新金融情況新聞稿的日平均年增率、發布日及下次預告發布時間；到時失效，不能以延長擷取時間冒充新觀測。
 
 `sourceCollectorNode` 除既有八項公司／產業來源外，另保存 `news.json` 與 `news-collection-status.json`。公告先試 RSS，再試 EIA Today in Energy 與 BLS CPI／就業原始公告 HTML；HTML 必須解析原始發布日，不取下次公布日期。`importerNode` 匯入 `news.json`，官方公告快照最多保留 36 小時擷取有效期。RSS 失敗紀錄保留，HTML 成功不代表數值序列已核驗；BLS 數值 API 與新聞公告用途分開，無須為 RSS 403 假定缺少 API key。
+
+## GitHub relay official import (v250)
+
+The public relay `wcr0936531039-png/macro-relay-service` runs the same official
+collectors on a GitHub schedule (Taipei about 05:55, 16:20, 22:40 and 23:10 on
+weekdays) and force-pushes only the payload files plus `manifest.json`
+(schema 1, `generatedAt`, each part's kind, bytes and SHA-256, collector errors)
+to its orphan branch `official-import`. No credentials, site URL or project ID
+are involved; the relay never deploys or calls the Site.
+
+When the Site env has `RELAY_OFFICIAL_IMPORT_ENABLED=true`, every
+`/api/automation/refresh-all` run first reads that manifest (rejected when it is
+older than 36 hours, malformed or names an unknown kind), then imports one group
+per poll — market snapshots with the roster, macro series, credit statistics,
+core CPI, industry sources and official news — through the same validation as
+`/api/official-data-import`. A part whose SHA-256 differs from the manifest is
+never submitted. A group whose hashes match the last successful import is
+skipped. A failed or rejected group is recorded with its reason and retried on
+the next patrol; it never blocks the scanner, modules or Gate audits, and the
+Worker's own direct capture still runs. Read the run's `officialImport`
+coverage row and `relayImport` in history. Without the env flag the patrol is
+unchanged; the manual collector and importer above remain the fallback.
